[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12302.71, "timestamp": "03:25:02", "text": "？我不會，我甚至都不加別人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12307.03, "timestamp": "03:25:07", "text": "。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12324.37, "timestamp": "03:25:24", "author": "@PanditJi.Y", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dbuBEqO3mJ9DX4Uu_LhA4jdzC_POgn5GfeMyztO06j5c73okFxwnXUaKWurMIj0mYXB_y53S_Q=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "when are u leaving for japan?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12324.83, "timestamp": "03:25:24", "text": "有時候，我和某人聊了好幾年，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12329.87, "timestamp": "03:25:29", "text": "我從來沒加過他們。嗯。太瘋狂了，真的。太瘋狂了。是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12344.71, "timestamp": "03:25:44", "text": "我喜歡有時候當我們意識到彼此還沒加好友的時候，我們會說：「等等，我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12359.83, "timestamp": "03:25:59", "text": "我們居然還沒加好友。」然後我們倆都懵了，因為我們聊了這麼久，竟然都沒注意到。挺搞笑的，比如「嗯，我確定。等等，我查一下。哦，算了"}]